{"speciesId":486,"names":{"fr":"Regigigas","es":"Regigigas","en":"Regigigas","ja":"レジギガス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"There is an enduring legend that states this Pokémon towed continents with ropes."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"There is an enduring legend that states this Pokémon towed continents with ropes."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It is said to have made Pokémon that look like itself from a special ice mountain, rocks, and magma."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It is believed to have shaped REGIROCK, REGICE, and REGISTEEL out of clay, ice, and magma."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It is believed to have shaped REGIROCK, REGICE, and REGISTEEL out of clay, ice, and magma."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"On dit qu’il a créé des Pokémon à son image à partir de glace, de roche et de magma."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It is said to have made Pokémon that look like itself from a special ice mountain, rocks, and magma."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"On dit qu’il a créé des Pokémon à son image à partir de glace, de roche et de magma."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It is said to have made Pokémon that look like itself from a special ice mountain, rocks, and magma."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It is said to have made Pokémon that look like itself from a special ice mountain, rocks, and magma."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It is said to have made Pokémon that look like itself from a special ice mountain, rocks, and magma."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"On dit qu’il a créé des Pokémon à son image à partir de glace, de roche et de magma."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Se dice que usó rocas, magma y un hielo especial de montaña para crear Pokémon con su aspecto."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It is said to have made Pokémon that look like itself from a special ice mountain, rocks, and magma."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"特殊な 氷山や 岩石 マグマから 自分の 姿に 似た ポケモンを つくったと 言われる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Une légende tenace veut que ce Pokémon ait traîné les continents en les attachant à des cordes."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Una antigua leyenda afirma que este Pokémon arrastraba continentes con cuerdas."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"There is an enduring legend that states this Pokémon towed continents with ropes."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"縄で 縛った 大陸を 引っ張って 動かしたという 伝説が 残されている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"On dit qu’il a créé des Pokémon à son image à partir de glace, de roche et de magma."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Se dice que usó rocas, magma y un hielo especial de montaña para crear Pokémon con su aspecto."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It is said to have made Pokémon that look like itself from a special ice mountain, rocks, and magma."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"特殊な 氷山や 岩石 マグマから 自分の 姿に 似た ポケモンを つくったと 言われる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Une légende tenace veut que ce Pokémon ait traîné les continents en les attachant à des cordes."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Una antigua leyenda afirma que este Pokémon arrastraba continentes con cuerdas."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"There is an enduring legend that states this Pokémon towed continents with ropes."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"縄で 縛った 大陸を 引っ張って 動かしたという 伝説が 残されている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Plusieurs légendes à travers le monde racontent que Regigigas aurait créé des Pokémon à son image."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Existen leyendas en todo el mundo que narran como Regigigas creó otros Pokémon a su imagen y semejanza."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"All over the world, there are legends that tell of Regigigas creating other Pokémon in its own image."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"自分の 姿に 似せて ポケモンを 作った 伝説が 世界中に 残されている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"On raconte qu’après avoir créé des Pokémon avec différentes matières, il aurait placé les continents à leur position actuelle."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Dicen que creó a otros Pokémon a partir de distintos materiales y que, después, colocó los continentes en su posición actual."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It’s said that Regigigas created other Pokémon from many different materials before it moved the continents to where they are today."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"さまざまな 材料で ポケモンを 作ってから 大陸を 現在の 場所に 移動させたと いわれる。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"According to legend, Regigigas pulled landmasses together and bound them with rope to create the continent of Hisui. Though I have my doubts, the story could well contain a shred of truth."}],"varieties":[{"id":486,"moves":[{"name":"pound","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[8,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",36],[20,"machine",0],[23,"level-up",36],[25,"level-up",36]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"level-up",1],[10,"tutor",0],[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"tutor",0],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"tutor",0],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"level-up",1],[10,"tutor",0],[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"tutor",0],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"tutor",0],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"level-up",1],[10,"tutor",0],[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1]